(7061288, 1074172, 30490, '<td valign="top">I find this image to be very appealing.... that being said I don''t really see the motion.  The Oats look very crisp and stationary to me.  So that being said I had a dilemma, rate for how much I like the image, or how closely I think it follows the challenge.  Fortunately for you I decided to rate on what I like, and this image got a "7"!</td>', 'I find this image to be very appealing.... that being said I don''t really see the motion.  The Oats look very crisp and stationary to me.  So that being said I had a dilemma, rate for how much I like the image, or how closely I think it follows the challenge.  Fortunately for you I decided to rate on what I like, and this image got a "7"!', '2013-07-05 19:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061289, 1074140, 30490, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, and nice capture.  I wonder what it looks like in color?</td>', 'Very cool idea, and nice capture.  I wonder what it looks like in color?', '2013-07-05 19:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061290, 1074154, 30490, '<td valign="top">This is not my favorite style of photography, the colorless (or almost) gritty images just don''t usually "speak to me".  BUT this one did, I "see" the motion in the petals and life the reference of the dead or dying flower blossoms.</td>', 'This is not my favorite style of photography, the colorless (or almost) gritty images just don''t usually "speak to me".  BUT this one did, I "see" the motion in the petals and life the reference of the dead or dying flower blossoms.', '2013-07-05 19:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061291, 1074169, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and capture.  Not many people have turntables still in their homes!</td>', 'Interesting idea and capture.  Not many people have turntables still in their homes!', '2013-07-05 19:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061292, 1074010, 30490, '<td valign="top">This image really appealed to me, I like the compactness of the bike and the blurring motion of the car.  An interesting juxtaposition!</td>', 'This image really appealed to me, I like the compactness of the bike and the blurring motion of the car.  An interesting juxtaposition!', '2013-07-05 19:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061293, 1074165, 30490, '<td valign="top">Just the hint of motion, or the "slight of hand" captured with Advanced Editing!  I like the Phantom nature of the pieces moving... it just works for me.  Nice job!</td>', 'Just the hint of motion, or the "slight of hand" captured with Advanced Editing!  I like the Phantom nature of the pieces moving... it just works for me.  Nice job!', '2013-07-05 19:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061294, 1074052, 30490, '<td valign="top">This image is so real I felt the need to cough and clear the "dust"!  Interesting image and a unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'This image is so real I felt the need to cough and clear the "dust"!  Interesting image and a unique take on the challenge.', '2013-07-05 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061295, 1074080, 30490, '<td valign="top">First of all I like your composition and the clarity of the objects.  The steam is an interesting idea on the theme of "motion".  The fruit looks a little plastic to me though...</td>', 'First of all I like your composition and the clarity of the objects.  The steam is an interesting idea on the theme of "motion".  The fruit looks a little plastic to me though...', '2013-07-05 19:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061296, 1074063, 30490, '<td valign="top">I so wish this was more in focus.  It is a good idea, but your execution just isn''t that great.</td>', 'I so wish this was more in focus.  It is a good idea, but your execution just isn''t that great.', '2013-07-05 19:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061297, 1073935, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I don''t really get it, even after viewing it 3 times.  Maybe your notes will enlighten me post roll over, or maybe it is just an "artsy" shot!</td>', 'Interesting, but I don''t really get it, even after viewing it 3 times.  Maybe your notes will enlighten me post roll over, or maybe it is just an "artsy" shot!', '2013-07-05 19:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061299, 1074102, 30490, '<td valign="top">This seems like a forced pairing to me.  The flowers as the still life and the clock for the motion, but it just isn''t working overall for me.  I think the problem is the depth of field, your two objects are just too far apart to work for this challenge.</td>', 'This seems like a forced pairing to me.  The flowers as the still life and the clock for the motion, but it just isn''t working overall for me.  I think the problem is the depth of field, your two objects are just too far apart to work for this challenge.', '2013-07-05 19:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7061300, 1074077, 30490, '<td valign="top">Huh?  I don''t get it at all, not sure what is still life and what is motion.  Going for the brown ribbon here?</td>', 'Huh?  I don''t get it at all, not sure what is still life and what is motion.  Going for the brown ribbon here?', '2013-07-05 19:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
