(7062964, 1074065, 19825, '<td valign="top">So, I voted this challenge but did not get back to comment like I should. I came back to review the results and see how the shots I liked finished. This was my favorite shot of the challenge. Even though I loved it, I was not surprised that this shot did not finish among the very top -- I am not sure how well the average voter would feel it fit the challenge theme. Regardless, I was surprised this finished below five and more surprised that it failed to get a single comment during voting. I love the colors and composition -- average score be damned. Nice shot.</td>', 'So, I voted this challenge but did not get back to comment like I should. I came back to review the results and see how the shots I liked finished. This was my favorite shot of the challenge. Even though I loved it, I was not surprised that this shot did not finish among the very top -- I am not sure how well the average voter would feel it fit the challenge theme. Regardless, I was surprised this finished below five and more surprised that it failed to get a single comment during voting. I love the colors and composition -- average score be damned. Nice shot.', '2013-07-09 12:10:37.000000', NULL, 0),
